  Sources, versions and the changes made:
    - 311 Service Requests from 2010 to Present, NYC Office of Technology and Innovation (311), dataset erm2-nwe9.
      https://data.cityofnewyork.us/d/erm2-nwe9
      Downloaded through its SODA API on 14 November 2026: every request created from 1 January to 31 December 2025
      whose complaint type starts "Noise" (833,000 requests).
      Changes: requests with no position left out; requests the Department of Environmental Protection closed as a
      duplicate of an earlier complaint left out; repeats from the same address about the same complaint type in the
      same clock hour counted once; each request given its hour of the week and a weight (1 over the number of times
      that hour of the week came round in 2025); each placed by its position into a community district; addresses,
      descriptions and resolution text left out.
    - Community Districts, NYC Department of City Planning, dataset 5crt-au7u (downloaded 14 November 2026).
      https://data.cityofnewyork.us/d/5crt-au7u
      Changes: outlines simplified by about 2 m; names and a kind (district, or park or airport) added.
    Nothing here implies endorsement by the City of New York or any of its agencies.

